    https://tanzil.net/docs/Text_License

Tanzil must be named wherever this text is used, and the text itself may not
be altered. The full copyright block travels with the data: it is at the head
of quran-uthmani.txt, and prepare-quran.mjs copies it verbatim into the
`notice` field of every one of the 114 generated files, so no copy of the text
in this repository exists without it. src/text.test.ts checks all 6,236 verses
and that notice against the pinned SHA256 on every run.

In the app, the attribution is the «مشروع تنزيل» link in «عن التطبيق».


The phrase timings
------------------
src/data/timings/husary.json and its ten siblings.

Generated once by scripts/prepare-timings.ts from the word-level segment
timings Quran.com publishes through api.qurancdn.com, one recitation per file.
What is stored is not their data: it is the cut positions computed from it, in
milliseconds, for the boundaries between the phrases of an ayah. Each file
records the recitation id and the exact endpoint it came from in its own
`source` field. Nothing is fetched from that interface at run time.


The fonts, which are not redistributed
--------------------------------------
Amiri, IBM Plex Sans Arabic and Reem Kufi are all under the SIL Open Font
License, and none of them is in this repository: index.html links them from
Google Fonts and the browser fetches them. If you ever vendor a font file
here, its OFL copy belongs beside it and its entry belongs in this file.

The same goes for the recitations. Every MP3 comes from everyayah.com or the
mirror at mirrors.quranicaudio.com at the moment it is played, and not one of
them is stored here. See data/README.md for who recorded what and where each
folder is.


If you bring in a new corpus, dataset, font or audio source, add it here in
the same pass.
